From 3ea936b98d682eb03046c852d11ac1042b8bd869 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:58:14 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] v850: Fix relocation checks

Report relocations without an ELF type and reloc prefix errors in data
directives instead of aborting. Check the 16 bit, split and 16 S1
relocations as signed 32 bit values and make zdaoff an offset from 0.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
---
